@AI4CUAV_HostAddress = https://localhost:7184

### Register a new (non-admin) account
POST {{AI4CUAV_HostAddress}}/api/Account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password1"
}

### Log in (returns a JWT)
POST {{AI4CUAV_HostAddress}}/api/Account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password1"
}

### Submit an order (public, no auth required)
POST {{AI4CUAV_HostAddress}}/api/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "detectionTypes": ["Thermal"],
  "recognitionType": 0,
  "enviroment": "Urban"
}

### List orders (admin only — replace {{token}} with a JWT from an admin login)
GET {{AI4CUAV_HostAddress}}/api/Orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
